    overview_html: `<p><strong>Battlefield 2042</strong> pivoted significantly toward live-service monetization after a rocky launch. The cosmetic shop features weapon skins, operator outfits, and battle pass content purchased with BFC (Battle Pass Coins). Prices are competitive with other AAA shooters but the cosmetics are primarily tied to seasonal passes.</p><p>The game shifted from a traditional premium model to aggressive seasonal content drops with exclusive cosmetics. While cosmetics don't affect gameplay, the constant rotation of limited-time items creates FOMO-driven purchasing pressure typical of live-service games.</p>`,
