    controversy_html: `<p>Minecraft Bedrock's Marketplace generates mild criticism for cosmetic pricing, which is higher than Java Edition cosmetics despite cosmetics being comparable. Some criticism focuses on the curated marketplace limiting cosmetic variety compared to Java's unlimited community mods. However, fairness criticism is minimal due to free cosmetic alternatives and the UGC creator support model.</p>`,
